  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## DressMe · BO1 agent pipeline (3 ideas)\n**BO agent** chooses the **idea agent** → the idea agent chooses the **action** → the action calls the **tools** → the BO agent answers.\nIn the app the two choices are made by the **LLM** (Qwen2.5 3B, Ollama) or a keyword rule; here the Switch nodes stand for those choices. Every action node calls the real agent action (`POST /bo/chat`).",
    "width": 1900,
    "height": 170,
    "color": 7
   },
   "name": "About",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
